,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688302101,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.68830453,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688307114,"data":"4. the kernel that actually runs, and the config list it was given\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688309649,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688312204,"data":"  decorator chain, outermost first: Heuristics -\u003e CachedAutotuner\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688314896,"data":"  autotuner found: True\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688317362,"data":"  module-level: NUM_WARPS = [2, 4, 8, 16]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688319948,"data":"  module-level: GATED_DELTA_RULE_FWD_H_NUM_WARPS = [2, 4]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688322468,"data":"  THE CONFIG SPACE, live: 4 configs\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688325004,"data":"    BV=32   num_warps=2   num_stages=2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688327507,"data":"    BV=32   num_warps=2   num_stages=1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688329969,"data":"    BV=32   num_warps=4   num_stages=2\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688332569,"data":"    BV=32   num_warps=4   num_stages=1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688335042,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688337426,"data":"  distinct BV        [32]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688339896,"data":"  distinct num_stages[1, 2]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688342385,"data":"  distinct num_warps [2, 4]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688344845,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688347214,"data":"  the model says, from the gate return values:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688349735,"data":"    num_stages [2, 1]      (check_shared_mem('ampere') = False)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688354476,"data":"    BV         [32]         (check_shared_mem('ada')    = False)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688357096,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688359514,"data":"  MODEL vs OBSERVED: AGREE\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688361964,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688364379,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688366941,"data":"5. one real forward, then the config autotune actually picked\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688369666,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688372266,"data":"  calling fla.ops.kda.chunk_kda  B=1 T=128 H=2 HV=2 K=128 V=128 dtype=torch.bfloat16  grad off\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688374924,"data":"  inputs: the STUDY's own generator (kda/kda_vs_fla.py:296 `rnd`), with\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688377513,"data":"  q,k L2-normalised. Raw Gaussians make the delta-rule matrix\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688380056,"data":"  (I - beta k k^T) have eigenvalues near 1 - K*beta and the state\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.68838259,"data":"  diverges; that is a property of the generator, not of fla.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688385123,"data":"  dtype: torch.bfloat16 is the only option. The FlashKDA verifier requires bf16\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688387693,"data":"  (flash_kda.py:64-88) and the study's call shape is bf16\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688390201,"data":"  (kda/baseline_pin.py:392). fp16 would be a different payload type\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688392741,"data":"  with a different numerics story, not a free substitute.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688395304,"data":"  returned o: shape=(1, 128, 2, 128) dtype=torch.bfloat16 finite=True  absmax=6.1523e-02\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688397896,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688400246,"data":"  Autotuner.cache has 1 entries after ONE call:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688402819,"data":"    key=(2, 2, 128, 128, 64, False, 'torch.bfloat16', 'torch.bfloat16', 'torch.bfloat16', 'torch.bfloat16', 'torch.float32', 'torch.bfloat16')\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688405481,"data":"      -\u003e BV=32 num_warps=4 num_stages=1  (from a space of 4)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688408058,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688410431,"data":"  the config space was the SHORTENED one, and autotune picked out of\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688412993,"data":"  exactly that short list. There was no refusal anywhere in this run.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688416981,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688420461,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688423819,"data":"6. dot precision, read out of a compiled artifact\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.68842632,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688428863,"data":"  A 32x32x32 tl.dot with no explicit input_precision, compiled here on\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688431421,"data":"  this card, and the PTX searched for mma.sync vs fma.rn.f32.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688433916,"data":"  This is not a read of a variable; it is a read of the code ptxas was\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688436431,"data":"  handed.  If fla had left TRITON_F32_DEFAULT alone, this would emit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688441538,"data":"  mma.sync with tf32 operands.  If it wrote 'ieee', it emits fma.rn.f32.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688444201,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688447688,"data":"  DOT_PROBE {\"ptx_mma_sync\": 0, \"ptx_mma\": 0, \"ptx_fma_rn_f32\": 256, \"ptx_cvt_tf32\": 0, \"ptx_target\": [\".version 8.7\", \".target sm_75\"], \"ptx_sha256\": \"a0c5c07077b886b15d4605423ed5e316e30290aa71c71b70e6217c29e68eb694\", \"cubin_sha256\": \"e3cb19a9362e93f10102b4e9e4935a54e192854eefdfa3804238f4cb89c6b3f5\", \"n_regs\": 59, \"n_spills\": 0, \"env_TRITON_F32_DEFAULT\": \"ieee\", \"triton_knob_fp32_default\": \"'ieee'\"}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688453261,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688455627,"data":"  and the knob itself, after fla was imported by that subprocess:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688458163,"data":"    os.environ['TRITON_F32_DEFAULT']          ieee\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688460718,"data":"    triton.knobs.language.fp32_default         'ieee'\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688463228,"data":"    fla IS_TF32_SUPPORTED                     False\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688465744,"data":"    is 'ieee' set by fla, or was it already there when fla loaded?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688468291,"data":"    BEFORE fla import: None\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688470771,"data":"    AFTER  fla import: 'ieee'\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688473291,"data":"    triton knob        : 'ieee'\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688475749,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688478104,"data":"  SOLVE_TRIL_DOT_PRECISION, the one dot fla pins explicitly:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688480628,"data":"    constexpr[ieee]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688483053,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688485454,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688488076,"data":"7. THE SCOPE LABEL, assembled from what was observed above\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.68849061,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688493119,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688495525,"data":"  fla on T4, degraded configuration - num_stages=[1, 2], BV=[32], num_warps=[2, 4], process-global IEEE fp32 (TRITON_F32_DEFAULT='ieee', written by fla at import) - this is what the reference does in its worst configuration, not what it does at its best\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.6884983959999,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688500768,"data":"  short form, for a table cell:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688525021,"data":"  fla/T4 degraded [stages=1/2, BV=32, warps=2/4, ieee-fp32 dots]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.68852801,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688530457,"data":"  NOT a claim about fla.  The same code on a card with \u003e= 166,912 B\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688533158,"data":"  optin shared memory and cc major \u003e= 8 gets num_stages=[2,3,4],\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688535913,"data":"  BV=[32,64] and tf32 dots.  Nothing here measures that.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688538509,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688540955,"data":"wrote kda_t4/out/gate_observed.{txt,json} and dot_probe.json\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688543545,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.68854599,"data":"\u003e\u003e\u003e stage gate exit=0  (335 s)\n"}
