,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688746428,"data":"B. THE AOT SWEEP -- same source, same triton, five architectures\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688748976,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688751518,"data":"  A Triton compiler does not need the hardware it targets, so the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688754032,"data":"  other cards in this study's card table can be COMPILED here, on a T4,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688756551,"data":"  by passing an explicit GPUTarget.  What comes out is a statement about\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688759079,"data":"  a compilation at that arch.  It is not a timing, and nothing in this\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688764033,"data":"  section may be read as one.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.68876663,"data":"  triton 3.6.0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688769131,"data":"  source: /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/fla/ops/common/chunk_delta_h.py\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.6887717,"data":"  sha256 ff461bcc40e9cd0b...  794 lines\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688774206,"data":"  stripped copy written to out/sass/aot_kernel.py\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688776703,"data":"  kernel body preserved byte-for-byte: True (745 lines, sha256 03dff62c1b07c384...)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688779283,"data":"  removed: @triton.heuristics({USE_G: ..., USE_GK: ..., ...}) and\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688781838,"data":"           @fla_cache_autotune(configs=[...], key=[...])\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688784384,"data":"  the second is why the autotune list is passed as explicit constexprs\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688786937,"data":"  below: an autotuner benchmarks its candidates, which needs a device,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688789482,"data":"  and it would benchmark them against THIS card's gate anyway.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688792015,"data":"  could not import the stripped kernel: NameError: name 'fla_cache_autotune' is not defined\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688794598,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688796966,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688799561,"data":"C. per-arch summary, from the gated config space (B only)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688802088,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.688804676,"data":"  no rows\n"}
