,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689487642,"data":"3. THE TABLE, scope in a column rather than in a footnote\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.68949014,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689492749,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689495102,"data":"  FLA_SCOPE = \"fla/T4 degraded [stages=1/2, BV=32, warps=2/4, ieee-fp32 dots]\"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689497738,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689500154,"data":"  shape                side                              device ms    min ms    x fla  scope\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689502767,"data":"  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689505452,"data":"  B1_T512_H4_K128_V128_C64 fla                                   2.143     2.116           fla/T4 degraded [stages=1/2, BV=32, warps=2/4, ieee-fp32 dots]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689508184,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689510834,"data":"  B1_T1024_H8_K128_V128_C64 fla                                   4.602     4.562           fla/T4 degraded [stages=1/2, BV=32, warps=2/4, ieee-fp32 dots]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689513607,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689516,"data":"  B2_T1024_H8_K128_V128_C64 fla                                   8.927     8.875           fla/T4 degraded [stages=1/2, BV=32, warps=2/4, ieee-fp32 dots]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689518694,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689521086,"data":"  B2_T2048_H8_K128_V128_C64 fla                                  19.279    18.207           fla/T4 degraded [stages=1/2, BV=32, warps=2/4, ieee-fp32 dots]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.68952378,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689526116,"data":"  'x fla' is side/fla: 1.00 means the side matched the reference on this\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689528658,"data":"  card, \u003e1 means the side was slower.  It is a ratio of two whole\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689531219,"data":"  operators, same inputs, same shape, same dtype, same card, same\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689533777,"data":"  process.  LEGALITY, answered before the number is read (notes/19 5.1):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689536452,"data":"  there is no per-op against a per-step anywhere above, and no\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689538974,"data":"  whole-step denominator is used.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689541442,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689543797,"data":"  Every fla cell above is a millisecond of the configuration named in\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689546332,"data":"  FLA_SCOPE.  It is not a millisecond of fla.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689548809,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689551152,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689553814,"data":"4. agreement, printed separately and NOT offered as evidence about the baseline\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689558745,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689561387,"data":"  notes/06 5b: two comparisons here were invalidated by porting the wrong\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.68956398,"data":"  object while passing every test.  A green agreement check is evidence\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689566539,"data":"  about the MATH.  Which artifact ran is established by kda_t4/pin_t4.py\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689569065,"data":"  from the registry, independently of this table.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689571568,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689573939,"data":"  no pair produced comparable outputs at any shape\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689576485,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689578833,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.6895814,"data":"5. THE CLEAN-vs-DEGRADED GAP: an open unknown, not a number\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689583898,"data":"============================================================================\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689586428,"data":"  MEASURED: fla on one T4, in the configuration this session observed\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689588973,"data":"  the T4's [49152, 65536] B of optin shared memory and its sm_75\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689591574,"data":"  compute capability force on it.  That is all.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.68959408,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689596456,"data":"  NOT MEASURED, and not estimated anywhere in this file: what the same\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689599017,"data":"  code does on a card with \u003e= 166,912 B optin shared memory AND cc major\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689601929,"data":"  \u003e= 8.  Scaling this number by a stage ratio, a tile ratio or a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689604558,"data":"  precision ratio would be inventing a measurement.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689607061,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689609425,"data":"  The four gap classes this project uses (notes/19 section 6):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689612019,"data":"    (i)   the DSL cannot express it\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689614494,"data":"    (ii)  the DSL can express it and does not find it\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689617033,"data":"    (iii) not yet implemented on the DSL side\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689619513,"data":"    (iv)  does not exist for this arch\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689622049,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.6896244,"data":"  REACHABLE by this measurement:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689626844,"data":"    (ii)  If a port lands close to fla-on-T4, the residual is a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689629382,"data":"          scheduling question and this run can address it, because both\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689632076,"data":"          sides are on the same silicon with the same numerics and the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689634598,"data":"          same degraded reference configuration.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689642793,"data":"    (i)   Reachable only negatively: a port that lands orders of\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689645359,"data":"          magnitude off cannot be separated into (i) vs (ii) by a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689647925,"data":"          timing alone.  The three-port ladder is the instrument for\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689656409,"data":"          that, and it is reported above.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689659063,"data":"    (iii) The ladder across the three ports measures exactly this, if\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689661625,"data":"          all three are present.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689664168,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689666537,"data":"  STRUCTURALLY UNREACHABLE by this measurement, at any run quality:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689669121,"data":"    (iv)  Fixed by the silicon.  There is no bf16 MMA below sm_80 and\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689671658,"data":"          IS_TF32_SUPPORTED is False, so fla's tl.dot cannot reach a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689674269,"data":"          tensor core on this card however long the run takes.  A gap\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689676863,"data":"          that is really 'fla emits HMMA and TinyGrad emits FFMA' is\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689679537,"data":"          (iv) here -- and is untouched by every number above, because\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689682099,"data":"          the HMMA never executes on this device.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689684737,"data":"    ALSO UNREACHABLE: fla-in-its-worst-config versus fla-in-its-best.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689687267,"data":"          That needs the card this study does not have.  It stays open.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1165.689689844,"data":"\n"}
